<figure id="S7.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.07190v1/mvp_dna_results_v2.png" id="S7.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:452/578;" width="452" height="578" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9. </span><span id="S7.F9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison with state-of-the-art methods tested on DNA-rendering dataset. ReCamMaster* is the finetuned version using MVHumanNet.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
